  "code" : "public int maxProduct(int[] nums) {\n    int n = nums.length;\n    double pre = 1, suff = 1;\n    double maxi = Integer.MIN_VALUE;\n\n    for (int i = 0; i < n; i++) {\n        if (pre == 0) pre = 1;\n        if (suff == 0) suff = 1;\n        pre *= nums[i];\n        suff *= nums[n - 1 - i];\n        maxi = Math.max(maxi, Math.max(pre, suff));\n    }\n    return (int) maxi;\n}",
